# M16 "Tav" (docs/PROTOCOL_UPGRADE.md §7), flow "m16_destroy" (Ortaocak; run-ui-flows.ps1 with EnterCoins = 5000 and
# UpgradeOutcome = "fail_from_6": attempts up to +5 succeed, +6 fails; at 1280x720, 1920x1080 and 1024x640 @150 %). A
# warrior takes the axe to +5; "Yükselt" for +6 asks first (red warning in the section, the question names the chance,
# the stone and the fee): "Vazgeç" sends nothing; "Yükselt" fails and the axe is destroyed (a red flash and the icon
# breaking apart; its bag slot empties; the result line in red).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m16_destroy
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kirici
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+npcs2+npcanimated 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene talk Demirci Ilgaz
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene shopbuy 166 10
waitfor world+modal+quantitybox 120
key enter
waitfor world+bought1+shopidle 600
clickon shop.tab.upgrade
waitfor world+upgradetab 60
rclickon inv.bag.0
waitfor world+upgradeitem+upgradeready 60
scene camera at:Demirci_Ilgaz@14 20 6
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+upgradeok1+upgradeidle 300
wait 20
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+upgradeok2+upgradeidle 300
wait 20
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+upgradeok3+upgradeidle 300
wait 20
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+upgradeok4+upgradeidle 300
wait 20
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+upgradeok5+upgradeidle 300
wait 20
scene expectupgrade 0 5
scene expectupgradepanel Tutmazsa eşya parçalanıp YOK OLUR!
wait 40
move 2 2
wait 3
screenshot 30_plus5_warning.png
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+modal+upgradeconfirm 60
expecttext messagebox.text Ocak Baltası (+5) → +6
expecttext messagebox.text YOK OLUR
expecttext messagebox.text Ham Tav Taşı
expecttext messagebox.text 36 Akçe
wait 3
screenshot 31_question.png
clickon messagebox.button1
waitfor world+upgradecancelled1 60
expect world+upgradeidle
scene expectupgrade 0 5
clickon upgrade.button
waitfor world+modal+upgradeconfirm 60
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+upgradedestroyed1+upgradeidle 300
wait 2
screenshot 32_destroyed_effect.png
expecttext upgrade.result Tav tutmadı: Ocak Baltası (+5) parçalandı!
scene expectitem 6 0
scene expectshopmessage parçalandı
wait 60
move 2 2
wait 3
screenshot 33_destroyed_after.png
scene upgradelog
quit